#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:9
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Health section provides an overview of the health of your "
"|Morpheus| appliance. It includes an appliance health summary in the "
"following areas:"
msgstr ""
"El |morpheus| Health sección proporciona un overview de el health de su "
"|Morpheus| appliance. It incluye un appliance health summary en lo siguiente"
" areas:"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:11
msgid ""
"**CPU:** Appliance CPU usage is checked. If usage is greater than 50%, this "
"indicator will be in a yellow or warning state. If |morpheus| is unable to "
"complete the check, it will be in a red or error state. Depending on "
"appliance performance and how frequently this indicator is in a warning "
"state, it may be necessary to upgrade to increase CPU. The **Overall** "
"health indicator will mirror the CPU health indicator"
msgstr ""
"**CPU:** Appliance CPU usage es checked. Si usage es greater than 50%, este "
"indicator será en a yellow o warning state. Si |morpheus| es unable a "
"complete el check, ello será en a red o error state. Depending en appliance "
"performance y how frequently este indicator es en a warning state, ello "
"puede be necessary a upgrade a increase CPU. El **Overall** health indicator"
" va a mirror el CPU health indicator"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Memory:** If swap usage is above 60% or |morpheus| memory usage is above "
"95%, this indicator will be in a yellow or warning state. If |morpheus| is "
"unable to complete the check for any reason, it will be in a red or error "
"state. Depending on appliance performance and how frequently this indicator "
"is in a warning state, it may be necessary to increase swap, upgrade the "
"appliance to add memory, or consider a different appliance architecture for "
"those using single-node appliances"
msgstr ""
"**Memory:** Si swap usage es above 60% o |morpheus| memory usage es above "
"95%, este indicator será en a yellow o warning state. Si |morpheus| es "
"unable a complete el check para cualquier reason, ello será en a red o error"
" state. Depending en appliance performance y how frequently este indicator "
"es en a warning state, ello puede be necessary a increase swap, upgrade el "
"appliance a agregar memory, o consider a diferente appliance architecture "
"para esos usando single-node appliances"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Storage:** If utilization of the filesystem mounted at \"/\" exceeds 80%, "
"this indicator will be in a yellow warned status. Above 90% will put this "
"indicator in red or error status"
msgstr ""
"**Storage:** Si utilization de el filesystem mounted en \"/\" exceeds 80%, "
"este indicator será en a yellow warned status. Above 90% va a put este "
"indicator en red o error status"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Database:** The database is checked. If the number of database connections"
" exceeds the configured maximum number of connections or if any test queries"
" are reported as being slow, this indicator will be in a yellow or warning "
"state. If |morpheus| is unable to communicate with the database, it will be "
"in a red or error state. In the database section further down the page, you "
"can check the number of maximum used connections against the number of max "
"connections. In the case of database connections exceeding the maximum, "
"consider increasing the maximum settings connection"
msgstr ""
"**Database:** El database es checked. Si el número de database connections "
"exceeds el configurado maximum número de connections o si cualquier test "
"queries son reported as being slow, este indicator será en a yellow o "
"warning state. Si |morpheus| es unable a communicate con el database, ello "
"será en a red o error state. En el database sección further down el página, "
"usted puede check el número de maximum usado connections against el número "
"de max connections. En el case de database connections exceeding el maximum,"
" consider increasing el maximum configuración connection"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Elastic:** Elasticsearch is polled for the health status of each index. If"
" any indices are not reporting a \"green\" health status, this indicator "
"will be in a yellow or warning state."
msgstr ""
"**Elastic:** Elasticsearch es polled para el health status de cada index. Si"
" cualquier indices son no reporting a \"green\" health status, este "
"indicator será en a yellow o warning state."

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Queues:** RabbitMQ queues are checked. Any queues containing more than "
"1000 messages are considered to be in an error state. Appliance Queue health"
" is given in a yellow or warning status when any queues are in such an error"
" state. In the Queues section further down the page you can see the "
"individual Queues listed and which have messages piling up. When the "
"appliance is unable to complete the check for any reason, this indicator "
"will be in a red or error state"
msgstr ""
"**Queues:** RabbitMQ queues son checked. Cualquier queues containing más "
"than 1000 messages son considered a be en un error state. Appliance Queue "
"health es given en a yellow o warning status cuando cualquier queues son en "
"such un error state. En el Queues sección further down el página usted puede"
" consulte la individual Queues listed y que tienen messages piling up. "
"Cuando el appliance es unable a complete el check para cualquier reason, "
"este indicator será en a red o error state"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:19
msgid "Health Levels"
msgstr "Health Levels"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:21
msgid ""
"Health levels provide a live representation of the current memory and CPU "
"load on the appliance. Bear in mind that in an HA appliance, this data will "
"be specific to the appliance node you happen to be accessing. By default, "
"|morpheus| does not include any endpoint or UI tool which can show you the "
"currently used app node. However, a plugin has been developed which can "
"surface this information if needed. See `this thread "
"<https://discuss.morpheusdata.com/t/custom-ping-endpoint-via-morpheus-"
"plugin/389>`_ in the |morpheus| official forums for additional details about"
" accessing and using the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Health niveles provide a live representation de el actual memory y CPU load "
"en el appliance. Bear en mind ese en un HA appliance, este data será "
"específico a el appliance node usted happen a be accessing. De forma "
"predeterminada, |morpheus| hace no include cualquier endpoint o UI tool que "
"puede show usted el currently usado app node. Sin embargo, a plugin ha sido "
"developed que puede surface este information si needed. See `este thread "
"<https://discuss.morpheusdata.com/t/personalizado-ping-endpoint-a través de-"
"morpheus-plugin/389>`_ en el |morpheus| official forums para adicional "
"detalles acerca de accessing y usando el plugin."

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Morpheus CPU:** Instantaneous amount of CPU capacity in use by |morpheus| "
"processes"
msgstr ""
"**Morpheus CPU:** Instantaneous amount de CPU capacity en usar por "
"|morpheus| processes"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:24
msgid ""
"**System CPU:** Instantaneous amount of CPU capacity in use by all processes"
msgstr ""
"**System CPU:** Instantaneous amount de CPU capacity en usar por todos "
"processes"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Morpheus Memory:** Instantaneous amount of system memory currently in use "
"by |morpheus| processes (see the Knowledge Base article linked in the TIP "
"box below for more information on how |morpheus| claims and manages "
"available memory)"
msgstr ""
"**Morpheus Memory:** Instantaneous amount de system memory currently en usar"
" por |morpheus| processes (consulte la Knowledge Base article linked en el "
"TIP box below para más information en how |morpheus| claims y manages "
"disponible memory)"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:26
msgid ""
"**System Memory:** Instantaneous amount of total system memory currently "
"claimed (this is commonly a high percentage, see the TIP box below)"
msgstr ""
"**System Memory:** Instantaneous amount de total system memory currently "
"claimed (este es commonly a high percentage, consulte la TIP box below)"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Used Swap:** Instantaneous amount of total available system swap in use"
msgstr ""
"**Used Swap:** Instantaneous amount de total disponible system swap en usar"

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Storage:** The instantaneous percentage utilization of the filesystem "
"mounted at \"/\""
msgstr ""
"**Storage:** El instantaneous percentage utilization de el filesystem "
"mounted en \"/\""

#: ../../administration/health/health.rst:30
msgid ""
"It's common to see a high percentage of system memory being used `due to the"
" way Morpheus allocates and manages memory "
"<https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-does-Morpheus-manage-the-"
"memory-it-uses?language=en_US>`_. If |morpheus| is performing well, high "
"system memory use is not necessarily an indicator that any action needs to "
"be taken."
msgstr ""
"It's common a see a high percentage de system memory being usado `due a el "
"way Morpheus allocates y manages memory "
"<https://soporte.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-hace-Morpheus-manage-el-"
"memory-ello-uses?language=en_US>`_. Si |morpheus| es performing well, high "
"system memory usar es no necessarily un indicator ese cualquier action needs"
" a be taken."

