"The |morpheus| logs section aggregates appliance-specific logs into one "
"list. If needed, users can export the logs by clicking :guilabel:`EXPORT`. "
"This action triggers a download containing the last 10,000 log entries as a "
"``.log`` file."
msgstr ""
"El |morpheus| logs sección aggregates appliance-específico logs en uno "
"lista. Si needed, usuarios puede export el logs por clicking "
":guilabel:`EXPORT`. Este action triggers a download containing el last "
"10,000 log entries as a ``.log`` file."

